      "run": 3,
      "steps": 12,
      "narrative": "In this desolate, post-apocalyptic world, I found myself searching for supplies and exploring the ruins of a once-great society. Today, I ventured into a greenhouse and found a trowel, some twine, and a basket. The trowel was worn along one edge, as if it had seen much use. I also found a basket, split along one side, suggesting it had been used to carry something heavy. After that, I descended a staircase to a sunken bed under a hinged pane, or cloche, but there was nothing of interest there except for the cloche itself. As I continue my search for survival, I will need to be careful and keep an eye out for anything that might prove useful.",
